title: "Synaptera"
abstract: "From synapse to wing: a pre-registered test of what a whole-brain connectome model controls in closed-loop Drosophila flight. A FlyWire v783 whole-brain LIF model (Brian2) coupled to the NeuroMechFly/FlyGym MuJoCo body; built on NeuroFly (https://github.com/seven-monarchs/NeuroFly)."
